# 3C-SiC Primary Knock-On Atom (PKA) Radiation Displacement Cascade with Tersoff-ZBL
units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

lattice custom 4.3596 a1 1.0 0.0 0.0 a2 0.0 1.0 0.0 a3 0.0 0.0 1.0 &
    basis 0.0 0.0 0.0 basis 0.5 0.5 0.0 basis 0.5 0.0 0.5 basis 0.0 0.5 0.5 &
    basis 0.25 0.25 0.25 basis 0.75 0.75 0.25 basis 0.75 0.25 0.75 basis 0.25 0.75 0.75
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 2 box basis 1 1 basis 2 1 basis 3 1 basis 4 1 basis 5 2 basis 6 2 basis 7 2 basis 8 2

mass 1 28.0855
mass 2 12.011

pair_style tersoff/zbl
pair_coeff * * /home/mahmoudasfour/sim_data/potentials/SiC.tersoff.zbl Si C

neighbor 1.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

velocity all create 300.0 87287 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

# Give central Silicon atom (#1) a 200 eV radiation PKA recoil velocity (~370 A/ps)
group pka id 1
velocity pka set 350.0 110.0 60.0

fix 1 all nve
fix dtfix all dt/reset 1 1.0e-5 1.0e-3 0.02 units box
thermo 20
thermo_style custom step time temp pe ke etotal press
run 100
